  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2e/Chicken_Coop.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713110707\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Chicken coop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chicken coop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Chicken coop</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animal-shelters-33414\" title=\"Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Shelter</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 1 • 12 • 23</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Houses </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Chicken</span><span title=\"Chicken(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chicken\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20191025192121\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span> x6</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Chicken coop</b> are shelters for <a href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chickens</a>. The first coop is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 1. It is the first shelter to be unlocked in the game.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The coop is a fenced square, on plain ground, along with a manger and a red chicken house. However, chickens are fed individually with <a href=\"/wiki/chicken-feed-2086\" title=\"Chicken Feed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chicken feed</a> and do not use the manger. They do not get into the house either.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>Each coop costs 5 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and can hold up to six chickens. The second coop is unlocked at level 12, and the last one at level 23. Building them takes no time.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>If you have some object obscuring your view of the chickens tap on the pen. If the harvest or feed icon are in color then you can harvest or feed at least one chicken.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal Shelters</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/alpaca-house-36823\" title=\"Alpaca House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Alpaca House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/beehive-tree-15804\" title=\"Beehive Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive Tree Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bird-house-35210\" title=\"Bird House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bird House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"142\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bunny-house-12523\" title=\"Bunny House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bunny House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cat-house-2711\" title=\"Cat House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cat House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chicken-coop-2715\" title=\"Chicken Coop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chicken Coop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/cow-pasture-2717\" title=\"Cow Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cow Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/dog-house-2713\" title=\"Dog House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Dog House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/donkey-stable-9426\" title=\"Donkey Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Donkey Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/goat-yard-2723\" title=\"Goat Yard\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Goat Yard\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/guinea-pig-house-35051\" title=\"Guinea Pig House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Guinea Pig House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/horse-stable-2709\" title=\"Horse Stable\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Horse Stable\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/kitten-house-18341\" title=\"Kitten House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Kitten House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lamb-pasture-36754\" title=\"Lamb Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lamb Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"58\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/pig-pen-2719\" title=\"Pig Pen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pig Pen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/puppy-house-18339\" title=\"Puppy House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puppy House\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/sheep-pasture-2721\" title=\"Sheep Pasture\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sheep Pasture\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-house-33971\" title=\"Squirrel House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Buildings</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830150157\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 608/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7334/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1788/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 728654/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   58.341      1 -total\n 73.50%   42.878      1 Template:Infobox\n 35.75%   20.857      4 Template:Infoicon\n 16.68%    9.734      1 Template:Navigation\n  9.63%    5.617      1 Template:AnimalSheltersMenu\